Algorithm (changed)

Structure: head->prev = last node, and last->next = head.

Write / Delete

Create the new text from the current text.
Delete all nodes after current until current->next == head.
Create a new node and set new->prev = current and new->next = head.
Set current->next = new and head->prev = new.
Move current to the new node.

Undo

If current == head, print “Nothing to undo” and stop.
Else, set current = current->prev.

Redo

If current->next == head, print “Nothing to redo” and stop.
Else, set current = current->next.

Display: Print current->text.
